--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google Material Symbols
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons (Apache License 2.0)
Files used: general.ts (16 UI-element icons), misc.ts (35 icons — full section), arrows.ts
            (44 icons — full section), network.ts (52 icons: the original 32 device/network
            glyphs plus 14 more media/comms/location icons), business.ts (44 icons: the
            original 26 org/people/process glyphs plus 18 more). Coordinates transformed from
            each icon's own viewBox into Nedito's shared 0 0 100 100 stencil space;
            re-themed via the node's own fill/stroke like all other hand-drawn generic
            shapes (not the unthemed `raw` path used for Azure/AWS/GCP's official
            brand-color icons).
Terms:   Apache License, Version 2.0 — full text at
         https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/blob/master/LICENSE

